+## GitHub integration (added 2026-10-27)
+
+`forge0-ci` (`backend/cli/ci.py`) runs an investigation headlessly against a checked-out repository
+(temporary SQLite, real sandbox). With a verified fix it commits the patch on a `forge0/fix-…` branch
+as `forge0[bot]`, pushes it and opens a pull request whose description is the evidence report
+(`services/pr_report.py`); without one it comments the evidence on the issue instead. It never opens
+a PR for an unverified patch. The workflow template is `integrations/github/forge0.yml`.
+
